{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>Like a harlot.</b> That it is not fitting to demand justice for her disgrace — <b>should one</b> of the people of the land <b>make our sister</b> so? For she is no harlot, and it is fitting to demand justice for her disgrace; and she is our sister, and it is fitting for us to demand justice for her disgrace. And when the inhabitant of the land reflects upon these things, it is not fitting that he should object."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:33:16.502926255Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}